WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:05.570
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:05.840 --> 02:07.000
Mr. Jiang has ordered

3
02:07.439 --> 02:08.800
that all of you go see him.

4
02:10.840 --> 02:12.319
Mr. Jiang invited us.

5
02:13.840 --> 02:15.639
Is it really necessary to make such a fuss?

6
02:15.639 --> 02:16.879
You carry a lot of weight, Mr. Qin.

7
02:17.319 --> 02:18.759
We worried that with too few men,

8
02:19.400 --> 02:20.400
you wouldn't come with us.

9
02:25.520 --> 02:26.159
Take them away.

10
02:26.680 --> 02:27.280
Let's go.

11
03:03.080 --> 03:03.719
Mr. Jiang.

12
03:04.280 --> 03:05.240
Everyone is here.

13
03:06.800 --> 03:08.360
You've truly honored me by coming.

14
03:09.000 --> 03:09.560
Please, sit.

15
03:16.400 --> 03:18.000
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

16
03:18.680 --> 03:19.400
Mr. Ma.

17
03:20.319 --> 03:21.960
No need to rush to explain.

18
03:22.400 --> 03:23.599
What matters most

19
03:23.759 --> 03:25.280
is that you made it out alive.

20
03:29.879 --> 03:30.680
Everyone,

21
03:31.759 --> 03:33.680
you should know very well

22
03:33.759 --> 03:36.360
why I invited you here today.

23
03:37.639 --> 03:38.319
Mr. Jiang,

24
03:40.639 --> 03:42.879
my husband and I were finally reunited.

25
03:43.520 --> 03:44.919
We'd like to return home as soon as possible.

26
03:46.680 --> 03:48.919
Returning home? That won't be easy.

27
03:49.240 --> 03:50.639
As long as we can get back to China,

28
03:50.680 --> 03:52.039
I doubt Country M's police

29
03:52.280 --> 03:53.879
can cross the border to arrest us.

30
03:56.680 --> 03:58.479
I recall you mentioned before

31
03:58.479 --> 04:01.000
that Mr. Zhuang owes a large sum to loan sharks.

32
04:01.080 --> 04:04.439
If you two just head back like this,

33
04:04.680 --> 04:08.719
will that really solve the problem?

34
04:09.439 --> 04:10.000
But...

35
04:10.120 --> 04:11.319
Let's hear what Mr. Jiang has to say first.

36
04:12.000 --> 04:13.280
What do you think he can say?

37
04:13.639 --> 04:14.759
You've already taken a wrong turn.

38
04:14.759 --> 04:16.160
I don't want you to keep making mistakes.

39
04:18.480 --> 04:19.720
In this world,

40
04:20.160 --> 04:21.240
there are only sides.

41
04:21.360 --> 04:22.639
Who's to say what's right or wrong?

42
04:23.480 --> 04:24.279
Miss Ge,

43
04:24.439 --> 04:25.720
think about yourself.

44
04:25.720 --> 04:27.199
To save your husband,

45
04:27.800 --> 04:30.360
you defied the laws of Country M

46
04:30.360 --> 04:31.360
and broke him out of prison.

47
04:33.560 --> 04:38.000
Was what you did right or wrong?

48
04:41.800 --> 04:42.319
All right.

49
04:43.079 --> 04:45.199
The reason I invited you all

50
04:45.279 --> 04:46.560
to take part in my business

51
04:46.600 --> 04:49.680
is that Mr. Thiradet and I believe

52
04:49.720 --> 04:51.519
you're all exceptional talents.

53
04:52.519 --> 04:53.759
For talents like you,

54
04:53.800 --> 04:55.120
if you were to keep living

55
04:55.120 --> 04:56.560
an ordinary life,

56
04:57.439 --> 04:59.160
that would be such a waste.

57
05:02.959 --> 05:03.639
Mr. Ma,

58
05:04.199 --> 05:07.199
our business can resume now, right?

59
05:07.600 --> 05:08.560
Of course.

60
05:11.120 --> 05:12.040
Brother Xiao Zhuang,

61
05:13.199 --> 05:15.519
we've braved a hail of bullets together.

62
05:16.040 --> 05:18.360
We're just doing business together.

63
05:18.680 --> 05:19.920
There's nothing to be afraid of.

64
05:22.639 --> 05:23.360
Mr. Ma,

65
05:24.319 --> 05:25.759
if we hadn't saved you,

66
05:25.959 --> 05:27.240
you might still be in prison.

67
05:27.959 --> 05:29.839
I hope you can honor that debt of gratitude

68
05:30.120 --> 05:31.759
and not drag my husband down this path again.

69
05:31.759 --> 05:32.879
What do you know?

70
05:33.720 --> 05:35.519
Brother Ma saved my life in prison!

71
05:35.720 --> 05:37.000
And our successful prison break this time

72
05:37.160 --> 05:38.800
was all thanks to Brother Ma and Mr. Qin.

73
05:38.959 --> 05:40.040
I don't care what you think.

74
05:40.040 --> 05:42.000
When I say no, I mean no!

75
05:42.839 --> 05:43.839
Do you think everyone in this world

76
05:43.920 --> 05:45.000
has a choice?

77
05:45.360 --> 05:46.199
Let me tell you,

78
05:46.399 --> 05:48.000
I had no choice a long time ago!

79
05:53.839 --> 05:54.759
What do you mean?

80
05:55.199 --> 05:57.240
I'm already working for Mr. Jiang.

81
05:59.920 --> 06:01.439
I didn't tell you because I didn't want you to worry.

82
06:10.319 --> 06:11.040
Let her go.

83
06:18.879 --> 06:19.879
Mr. Zhuang,

84
06:21.120 --> 06:24.279
you need to decide whether to stay or go.

85
06:24.360 --> 06:25.079
Stay.

86
06:26.920 --> 06:28.639
But I have to explain things to my wife.

87
06:29.560 --> 06:30.439
Don't bother going.

88
06:31.399 --> 06:33.120
She won't listen to anything you say right now.

89
06:33.680 --> 06:35.279
Let me go talk to her for you instead.

90
07:01.160 --> 07:01.639
All right.

91
07:03.399 --> 07:04.920
Now that the women are gone,

92
07:05.279 --> 07:07.920
we can get down to men's business.

93
07:16.759 --> 07:18.319
Are you afraid your man will take the wrong path,

94
07:19.439 --> 07:21.439
or afraid he won't come back to you?

95
07:26.279 --> 07:27.839
I used to be just like you.

96
07:28.120 --> 07:29.199
I always thought the path he walked

97
07:29.199 --> 07:30.439
was a road of no return.

98
07:32.000 --> 07:34.160
But in truth, every life is a one-way road.

99
07:34.839 --> 07:37.160
Everyone faces death in the end.

100
07:37.759 --> 07:39.319
But I don't want him to die so young.

101
07:40.959 --> 07:41.720
If Brother Rong hadn't

102
07:41.720 --> 07:43.360
saved your husband in prison,

103
07:43.600 --> 07:45.600
he might never have walked out.

104
07:47.079 --> 07:49.240
Danger is everywhere in life.

105
07:49.759 --> 07:50.920
Instead of worrying every day,

106
07:51.120 --> 07:52.600
you might as well learn to let it go.

107
07:55.000 --> 07:55.959
Have you really never

108
07:55.959 --> 07:57.199
worried about him?

109
08:00.480 --> 08:01.480
If I worry too much,

110
08:01.480 --> 08:02.600
it'll only get in his way.

111
08:02.920 --> 08:04.040
I'm his woman.

112
08:04.920 --> 08:07.120
Why burden him with my worries?

113
08:09.240 --> 08:10.160
At the end of the day,

114
08:10.560 --> 08:12.680
a woman can't stop a man from doing what he wants.

115
08:12.680 --> 08:14.120
Rather than tying his hands,

116
08:14.839 --> 08:16.199
it's better to let him be free

117
08:16.279 --> 08:17.680
to do what he wants.

118
08:20.480 --> 08:23.839
I often pray at temples

119
08:24.680 --> 08:26.439
just to send all my best blessings

120
08:26.439 --> 08:27.319
to him.

121
08:28.160 --> 08:29.480
I love Brother Rong,

122
08:30.720 --> 08:33.440
so whatever decision he makes,

123
08:33.519 --> 08:34.639
I'm willing to support him.

124
08:37.240 --> 08:38.639
You saw it for yourself just now.

125
08:39.000 --> 08:40.240
Your husband has already made

126
08:40.279 --> 08:41.759
his choice.

127
08:42.200 --> 08:43.759
The only choice you have now

128
08:44.639 --> 08:45.799
is to stay by his side

129
08:46.440 --> 08:47.559
or walk away.

130
08:47.840 --> 08:48.840
What you choose

131
08:49.399 --> 08:50.559
depends on whether

132
08:50.840 --> 08:51.840
you value him

133
08:51.919 --> 08:53.000
more than yourself.

134
08:53.440 --> 08:54.240
And you?

135
08:55.720 --> 08:58.200
Are you willing to live on edge your whole life?

136
09:00.399 --> 09:02.320
Brother Rong already has a plan.

137
09:02.399 --> 09:03.480
In a few years,

138
09:04.679 --> 09:06.759
we'll find a way to settle abroad.

139
09:07.960 --> 09:08.519
From then on, we'll live

140
09:08.519 --> 09:10.879
a peaceful and quiet life.

141
09:15.200 --> 09:15.879
When the time comes,

142
09:15.919 --> 09:17.080
you and your husband should join us.

143
09:17.840 --> 09:20.440
We can keep each other company in a foreign land.

144
09:26.080 --> 09:26.759
All right.

145
09:31.000 --> 09:31.759
Mr. Ma.

146
09:32.600 --> 09:33.399
To be honest,

147
09:33.639 --> 09:35.360
I never expected

148
09:35.919 --> 09:38.000
that you'd actually make it out.

149
09:38.320 --> 09:39.039
That goes to show

150
09:39.080 --> 09:42.240
Mr. Thiradet's judgment was spot on.

151
09:43.000 --> 09:44.759
I was just lucky.

152
09:45.200 --> 09:47.320
It was mostly thanks to Old Qin.

153
09:47.720 --> 09:49.159
We're in the same boat.

154
09:49.360 --> 09:50.720
If anything happened to you,

155
09:51.080 --> 09:53.240
I wouldn't be able to face Mr. Jiang.

156
09:55.480 --> 09:56.960
Rest assured, Mr. Jiang.

157
09:57.559 --> 10:00.679
I'll repay my debt as soon as possible.

158
10:01.960 --> 10:03.120
It's just a small sum.

159
10:03.360 --> 10:06.679
Consider it a welcoming gift for you, Mr. Ma.

160
10:09.240 --> 10:10.919
Then thank you, Mr. Jiang.

161
10:13.840 --> 10:16.960
Since we'll be working together from now on,

162
10:17.200 --> 10:18.519
I think we ought to

163
10:18.519 --> 10:20.399
trust each other more.

164
10:20.879 --> 10:24.120
Mr. Jiang, regarding my wife...

165
10:27.679 --> 10:29.960
That was merely

166
10:30.360 --> 10:31.679
a little test for you, Mr. Ma.

167
10:32.159 --> 10:36.200
Since we've never worked together before.

168
10:37.039 --> 10:38.279
I can assure you

169
10:38.320 --> 10:39.080
that from now on,

170
10:39.120 --> 10:41.399
your family will be kept out of this.

171
10:41.480 --> 10:42.080
Thank you.

172
10:46.000 --> 10:48.720
In fact, your survival

173
10:48.960 --> 10:51.279
was entirely Mr. Thiradet's call.

174
10:51.360 --> 10:52.480
To tell you the truth,

175
10:52.480 --> 10:54.159
The Four Great Families of Country M

176
10:54.200 --> 10:55.240
have been keeping

177
10:55.240 --> 10:57.000
far too close an eye on Mr. Thiradet.

178
10:57.519 --> 10:58.360
Mr. Thiradet

179
10:58.440 --> 10:59.559
has had no chance whatsoever

180
10:59.559 --> 11:01.039
to get involved in the family businesses.

181
11:01.440 --> 11:04.159
As for me, I'm tied down at the factory.

182
11:04.399 --> 11:05.559
We really need you all

183
11:06.159 --> 11:07.799
to help us open up new distribution channels.

184
11:08.480 --> 11:09.440
From this point on,

185
11:09.759 --> 11:11.200
I don't want you all to be

186
11:11.559 --> 11:14.440
just Jiang Liye's downlines.

187
11:14.960 --> 11:16.320
You'll be my business partners.

188
11:16.720 --> 11:17.879
The profit margin I offer you

189
11:17.919 --> 11:21.320
is far higher than a regular downline's.

190
11:26.360 --> 11:27.039
How about it?

191
11:28.360 --> 11:29.559
Any objections?

192
11:33.200 --> 11:34.320
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

193
11:35.840 --> 11:36.600
Good.

194
11:37.879 --> 11:40.559
Here's to a fruitful partnership.

195
11:53.919 --> 11:55.080
The suspect's name is Gao Jian.

196
11:55.480 --> 11:56.639
Into Liang Wenbiao's injection,

197
11:56.679 --> 11:58.559
he put a heavy dose of purified narcotics,

198
11:58.919 --> 12:00.679
which causes sudden cardiac arrest.

199
12:01.399 --> 12:02.759
Take Gao Jian's trace evidence right away

200
12:02.759 --> 12:03.360
and send it to forensics.

201
12:03.360 --> 12:03.759
Yes, sir.

202
12:04.399 --> 12:05.159
Bring Gao Jian in for questioning.

203
12:05.320 --> 12:05.759
Understood.

204
12:16.919 --> 12:17.639
Do you recognize him?

205
12:24.919 --> 12:26.120
The Dongshan Park murder case...

206
12:26.120 --> 12:26.879
You know about it, right?

207
12:26.960 --> 12:27.960
I killed them.

208
12:28.559 --> 12:29.480
You're quite straightforward.

209
12:29.720 --> 12:30.799
But why do I feel

210
12:31.000 --> 12:32.600
you couldn't pull this off alone?

211
12:32.759 --> 12:36.000
And you're probably not the mastermind, either.

212
12:38.559 --> 12:39.399
At the scene,

213
12:39.440 --> 12:40.919
we found footprints from three different people.

214
12:41.440 --> 12:43.159
And under the victim's fingernails,

215
12:43.519 --> 12:45.519
there's skin tissue from two other killers.

216
12:47.039 --> 12:47.960
Did you think

217
12:48.240 --> 12:50.320
that destroying trace evidence on the body

218
12:50.799 --> 12:52.000
would keep us from identifying them?

219
12:52.840 --> 12:54.399
Through Deoxyribonucleic acid testing,

220
12:54.720 --> 12:56.679
we can still identify the victim.

221
12:57.320 --> 12:58.360
And on the victim's body,

222
12:58.399 --> 12:59.240
if there is any of the killer's

223
12:59.279 --> 13:00.480
Deoxyribonucleic acid left behind,

224
13:00.639 --> 13:02.600
we can still find out who the killer is.

225
13:03.000 --> 13:03.840
Deoxyribonucleic acid?

226
13:04.600 --> 13:06.480
You mean a man's semen, right?

227
13:08.399 --> 13:09.360
Saying all that

228
13:09.919 --> 13:11.120
is completely pointless.

229
13:11.320 --> 13:12.360
It won't change anything,

230
13:12.600 --> 13:13.679
won't help anyone,

231
13:14.279 --> 13:15.600
and won't take the fall for anyone.

232
13:15.679 --> 13:16.840
I did it alone.

233
13:17.240 --> 13:18.240
It has nothing to do with Brother Four.

234
13:18.679 --> 13:19.320
Brother Four?

235
13:22.919 --> 13:23.720
Four-Legged Snake?

236
13:26.240 --> 13:27.919
I never mentioned Four-Legged Snake.

237
13:29.000 --> 13:31.759
So it was Four-Legged Snake who teamed up with Liang Wenbiao.

238
13:33.600 --> 13:35.279
Criminal Investigation just called.

239
13:36.240 --> 13:39.320
Liang Wenbiao admitted his ties to Four-Legged Snake.

240
13:39.600 --> 13:41.159
Didn't he refuse to say anything before?

241
13:42.279 --> 13:43.960
He knows Four-Legged Snake wants to kill him,

242
13:44.120 --> 13:46.200
so why would he let him get off easy?

243
13:48.080 --> 13:49.759
Now, only from Gao Jian's mouth

244
13:50.000 --> 13:51.840
can we find Four-Legged Snake's location.

245
13:53.120 --> 13:54.879
I'm not Four-Legged Snake's man.

246
13:55.039 --> 13:56.600
I just do the job for money.

247
13:57.240 --> 13:58.840
I know nothing about his business.

248
13:59.080 --> 14:00.240
You do the job for money?

249
14:00.720 --> 14:01.559
What kind of job?

250
14:02.399 --> 14:03.279
Kill people for him.

251
14:06.120 --> 14:07.519
Since I've been caught,

252
14:08.000 --> 14:09.200
I have nothing left to say.

253
14:09.559 --> 14:10.759
The crimes to my name

254
14:11.679 --> 14:13.000
would get me executed several times over.

255
14:13.960 --> 14:15.879
Then why didn't you run after the killing?

256
14:15.919 --> 14:17.159
I was planning to run,

257
14:17.559 --> 14:19.720
but I never expected you'd find me so fast.

258
14:21.240 --> 14:22.159
What about Four-Legged Snake?

259
14:22.279 --> 14:23.159
He's running too.

260
14:24.240 --> 14:25.120
But he said

261
14:25.240 --> 14:27.840
he'd take us to meet his boss first,

262
14:28.480 --> 14:30.399
then take us to the US to lay low.

263
14:30.799 --> 14:32.240
And this boss he mentioned,

264
14:32.600 --> 14:33.799
is he called Chameleon?

265
14:33.919 --> 14:34.879
Maybe.

266
14:35.799 --> 14:36.840
But I've been wondering...

267
14:36.840 --> 14:39.879
Isn't Chameleon just Four-Legged Snake?

268
14:41.360 --> 14:44.440
What kind of person is this Chameleon?

269
14:44.679 --> 14:45.440
I don't know.

270
14:46.200 --> 14:47.080
All I know is

271
14:47.159 --> 14:49.240
Four-Legged Snake calls him Chameleon,

272
14:50.039 --> 14:51.840
and on the phone, he calls him Brother Long.

273
14:52.360 --> 14:54.080
The deaths of Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying

274
14:54.279 --> 14:56.360
directly clear Chen Hai of suspicion.

275
14:56.960 --> 14:58.559
Could Chameleon actually be Chen Hai?

276
15:03.919 --> 15:06.200
We'll talk about you and Four-Legged Snake later.

277
15:06.840 --> 15:07.879
First, tell us...

278
15:08.440 --> 15:09.679
where Four-Legged Snake is hiding.

279
15:09.720 --> 15:11.279
If I wanted to talk, I would've by now.

280
15:11.679 --> 15:13.799
You caught me, I'll take the hit.

281
15:13.960 --> 15:15.480
Why would I sell out my own people?

282
15:15.559 --> 15:16.399
Your own people?

283
15:18.240 --> 15:19.200
Even now,

284
15:19.559 --> 15:20.519
do you really think

285
15:20.799 --> 15:22.360
they still see you as one of them?

286
15:26.360 --> 15:29.600
You must know Guo Yingying and Zhang Xuebin.

287
15:31.759 --> 15:33.879
They were also once what you called

288
15:33.919 --> 15:34.960
"one of our own."

289
15:36.080 --> 15:36.879
And look what happened to them.

290
15:37.279 --> 15:38.840
Do you want to end up just like them?

291
15:40.720 --> 15:41.840
That outfit of yours...

292
15:42.159 --> 15:43.720
can sacrifice at any moment

293
15:43.960 --> 15:45.879
the very people you call "one of your own."

294
15:46.159 --> 15:48.240
I never said Four-Legged Snake was one of my guys.

295
15:48.840 --> 15:49.919
He's just my boss.

296
15:49.960 --> 15:52.000
I was only passing through Nanhai.

297
15:52.440 --> 15:53.720
None of them here are my brothers.

298
15:55.000 --> 15:57.320
It's just that two of my guys

299
15:58.159 --> 15:59.840
are with Four-Legged Snake right now.

300
16:00.080 --> 16:01.480
If I give up Four-Legged Snake,

301
16:02.840 --> 16:04.200
wouldn't I be selling them out?

302
16:04.279 --> 16:05.720
Those two guys you mentioned...

303
16:06.039 --> 16:06.720
They're the ones who pulled the job with you

304
16:06.720 --> 16:07.960
at Dongshan Park, right?

305
16:12.759 --> 16:13.840
Chief Huang was right.

306
16:14.159 --> 16:15.840
This criminal syndicate appears loose,

307
16:16.039 --> 16:17.360
plagued even by infighting,

308
16:17.559 --> 16:18.720
but in truth, it's tightly organized.

309
16:18.759 --> 16:20.320
When trouble brews, any manipulation

310
16:20.639 --> 16:23.200
creates massive roadblocks for our case.

311
16:27.240 --> 16:28.639
No matter how tight their ranks,

312
16:30.240 --> 16:31.960
we'll find a weakness.

313
16:37.360 --> 16:38.960
What I'm about to say

314
16:39.759 --> 16:41.279
is my personal confession.

315
16:43.559 --> 16:44.879
In everyone's eyes,

316
16:46.000 --> 16:48.320
I'm an executive at Zhongtian Logistics

317
16:49.159 --> 16:50.879
with a happy family.

318
16:52.279 --> 16:54.159
But what no one knows is,

319
16:55.399 --> 16:57.399
beneath the mask of an ordinary man,

320
16:57.799 --> 17:00.120
lies the identity of a criminal.

321
17:01.399 --> 17:02.399
Two years ago,

322
17:03.360 --> 17:05.599
I met drug trafficker Cheng Weimin.

323
17:06.079 --> 17:07.039
He told me

324
17:08.319 --> 17:09.960
drug dealing was fast money.

325
17:10.480 --> 17:12.319
Blinded by greed,

326
17:13.319 --> 17:15.359
I used my position at Zhongtian...

327
17:18.880 --> 17:20.119
Looks like for now,

328
17:20.480 --> 17:22.240
we won't be able to make him talk.

329
17:25.960 --> 17:27.480
Well? Did you find anything?

330
17:28.240 --> 17:28.880
What do you think?

331
17:30.200 --> 17:31.680
The kid claimed he was just passing through Nanhai

332
17:31.920 --> 17:32.519
and had no buddies there.

333
17:32.799 --> 17:33.839
Which means

334
17:34.480 --> 17:36.920
he must've met those two partners in Jincheng.

335
17:37.880 --> 17:40.799
In Nanhai, I tracked down Qian Feng,

336
17:41.079 --> 17:44.519
along with downlines Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

337
17:51.480 --> 17:53.519
Guan Qiang, make a trip to Jincheng.

338
17:53.920 --> 17:54.319
Yes, sir.

339
18:00.960 --> 18:01.440
Captain Bai.

340
18:01.559 --> 18:02.720
Zhou Fuhai didn't commit suicide.

341
18:03.839 --> 18:04.599
Are you sure?

342
18:05.279 --> 18:05.759
Positive.

343
18:10.559 --> 18:11.599
Lately,

344
18:12.359 --> 18:14.279
my conscience has been tormenting me.

345
18:15.000 --> 18:16.519
I let down my family

346
18:17.119 --> 18:18.400
and the leaders who trusted me.

347
18:19.319 --> 18:20.519
The mistakes I made

348
18:21.519 --> 18:23.160
can no longer be undone.

349
18:23.599 --> 18:25.720
I can only atone with my death.

350
18:27.799 --> 18:28.839
What are you getting at?

351
18:28.920 --> 18:31.160
I finally found what's wrong with this recording.

352
18:31.759 --> 18:33.640
When someone commits suicide to escape guilt,

353
18:33.680 --> 18:35.920
they're bound to feel intense inner turmoil.

354
18:36.160 --> 18:37.400
They might feel remorse,

355
18:37.680 --> 18:39.720
internal struggle, or hesitation,

356
18:39.880 --> 18:41.319
or even become incoherent.

357
18:41.839 --> 18:43.519
Yet in Zhou Fuhai's recording,

358
18:43.839 --> 18:46.039
his speech flows smoothly and his breathing is steady.

359
18:46.079 --> 18:48.039
There isn't a single hesitation from start to finish.

360
18:49.319 --> 18:50.559
It doesn't sound heartfelt.

361
18:50.920 --> 18:52.759
It sounds more like he's reading a suicide note.

362
18:54.000 --> 18:56.680
If Zhou Fuhai had actually written a suicide note,

363
18:57.640 --> 18:59.599
he wouldn't need to record it all over again.

364
18:59.720 --> 19:02.319
I didn't really believe it was suicide either.

365
19:03.799 --> 19:06.240
If the note wasn't written by him at all,

366
19:06.440 --> 19:07.759
then Zhou Fuhai's death

367
19:08.160 --> 19:09.480
is very likely...

368
19:10.079 --> 19:10.960
homicide.

369
19:11.119 --> 19:13.559
Right. The killer is extremely cunning.

370
19:14.039 --> 19:14.680
He knew

371
19:14.799 --> 19:16.960
that if he made Zhou Fuhai write a suicide note,

372
19:17.200 --> 19:19.160
Zhou Fuhai might well use it

373
19:19.240 --> 19:21.680
to leave us clues through his handwriting.

374
19:22.160 --> 19:23.480
Little did he know

375
19:23.640 --> 19:25.200
that this very recording

376
19:25.359 --> 19:27.599
would instead give away the truth.

377
19:28.039 --> 19:30.119
The killer's real motive

378
19:30.119 --> 19:30.960
for making Zhou Fuhai record this

379
19:31.039 --> 19:32.359
was simply to sever

380
19:32.359 --> 19:34.039
any connection between Chen Hai and Zhou Fuhai.

381
19:34.279 --> 19:35.599
If Zhou Fuhai's death

382
19:36.519 --> 19:38.319
wasn't done by Four-Legged Snake's men,

383
19:38.319 --> 19:41.359
then the most likely suspect is...

384
19:41.440 --> 19:42.079
Hu Dong.

385
19:42.599 --> 19:43.559
Besides,

386
19:43.680 --> 19:45.119
the Shanxi police already confirmed:

387
19:45.319 --> 19:47.200
Hu Dong never returned to his hometown.

388
19:49.359 --> 19:50.200
You're right.

389
19:50.519 --> 19:52.880
We'll soon be meeting Chen Hai again.

390
19:56.000 --> 19:57.279
Head back to the crime scene once more

391
19:57.440 --> 19:58.400
and see if there are any new clues.

392
19:58.680 --> 19:59.160
Yes, sir.

393
21:03.720 --> 21:05.319
Every time I arrive at a crime scene,

394
21:06.119 --> 21:08.039
I imagine the entire crime playing out.

395
21:08.759 --> 21:10.880
If I were the killer, what would I do?

396
23:00.720 --> 23:01.640
Is this property management?

397
23:47.519 --> 23:49.160
Hello, how can I help you?

398
23:49.759 --> 23:50.279
Excuse me,

399
23:50.359 --> 23:52.200
who was on duty on Thursday night?

400
23:52.960 --> 23:54.519
Just a moment, let me check for you.

401
24:01.119 --> 24:03.400
Master Li was on duty on Thursday night.

402
24:03.880 --> 24:04.759
Is he around right now?

403
24:04.880 --> 24:05.240
Yes, he is.

404
24:05.240 --> 24:06.920
I'll go get him for you. Please wait.

405
24:16.799 --> 24:17.799
I realized

406
24:19.000 --> 24:20.599
that I've reached the end of the line.

407
24:21.599 --> 24:22.559
All this time,

408
24:23.400 --> 24:25.400
my conscience has been tormented.

409
24:27.000 --> 24:28.480
I've let down my family

410
24:29.160 --> 24:30.319
and the superiors who trusted me.

411
24:32.359 --> 24:33.480
The mistakes I've made

412
24:34.559 --> 24:36.160
can no longer be undone.

413
24:37.640 --> 24:40.920
I can only atone through my death.

414
24:48.559 --> 24:49.000
What do you think?

415
24:49.400 --> 24:50.400
Right at the end,

416
24:51.039 --> 24:52.480
there's a sound like rustling paper.

417
24:52.759 --> 24:53.640
Although it's very faint,

418
24:54.279 --> 24:55.599
through audio isolation,

419
24:55.720 --> 24:56.799
it can still be identified.

420
24:58.640 --> 25:01.039
Add in the footsteps at 1:37,

421
25:01.400 --> 25:02.799
and we can basically confirm

422
25:03.559 --> 25:04.599
that before Zhou Fuhai died,

423
25:04.880 --> 25:06.079
he definitely wasn't alone.

424
25:13.920 --> 25:14.960
This is Master Li.

425
25:14.960 --> 25:15.519
I'll leave you to it.

426
25:15.799 --> 25:16.839
Hello, Officer.

427
25:17.680 --> 25:18.400
What can I do for you?

428
25:18.960 --> 25:19.880
I'd like to ask you about

429
25:19.880 --> 25:21.519
Zhou Fuhai from Room 308.

430
25:23.960 --> 25:25.079
Actually, property management

431
25:25.119 --> 25:27.240
posted a water shutoff notice by the elevators,

432
25:27.359 --> 25:29.200
but that night, lots of people still called

433
25:29.240 --> 25:30.200
to ask about the shutoff.

434
25:30.519 --> 25:31.519
Room 308 called too.

435
25:32.000 --> 25:33.160
He had quite a temper.

436
25:33.559 --> 25:34.599
He said he was in the shower

437
25:35.119 --> 25:36.920
and told me to fix the water right away.

438
25:37.880 --> 25:38.920
Just as I was about to explain,

439
25:38.920 --> 25:40.000
he hung up the phone.

440
25:42.720 --> 25:44.599
Are you sure he hung up?

441
25:49.000 --> 25:49.400
Sorry...

442
25:49.720 --> 25:51.720
Well, he just suddenly stopped talking.

443
25:52.200 --> 25:52.960
After a moment,

444
25:53.160 --> 25:54.200
hearing no response from him,

445
25:54.519 --> 25:55.759
I hung up the phone.

446
25:58.039 --> 25:59.119
Then did you happen to hear

447
25:59.119 --> 26:00.240
any other sounds?

448
26:00.319 --> 26:01.759
Or rather, did you hear

449
26:01.759 --> 26:02.799
anyone else's voice?

450
26:04.240 --> 26:06.240
Anyone else's voice?

451
26:06.279 --> 26:07.039
Let me think...

452
26:12.039 --> 26:13.839
It seemed like someone came to his place.

453
26:14.279 --> 26:17.640
He called him Ah Dong or something.

454
26:18.480 --> 26:19.759
Right, it was Ah Dong.

455
26:23.559 --> 26:24.960
Please take me to the surveillance room to check.

456
26:25.000 --> 26:25.440
Sure, sure.

457
26:25.519 --> 26:26.200
Come, this way please.

458
26:45.680 --> 26:46.400
Pause it.

459
26:51.160 --> 26:52.279
Do we have a clear shot of his face?

460
26:53.279 --> 26:54.960
This is the clearest clip we have.

461
26:59.039 --> 26:59.920
Please take all the footage of him

462
26:59.920 --> 27:01.359
entering and leaving the building

463
27:01.480 --> 27:02.400
and copy it for me.

464
27:02.519 --> 27:02.960
All right.

465
27:17.880 --> 27:18.880
We'll wait for Li Xiao.

466
27:27.920 --> 27:28.480
Captain Bai.

467
27:28.559 --> 27:29.880
Traffic police reported back that

468
27:30.119 --> 27:31.160
on the day Hu Dong took leave,

469
27:31.359 --> 27:32.799
he never left Nanhai at all.

470
27:40.440 --> 27:42.400
Captain Bai, we can confirm it's homicide.

471
27:42.440 --> 27:43.599
The killer is someone named A-Dong.

472
27:43.960 --> 27:45.319
I think it's that Hu Dong.

473
27:48.839 --> 27:49.839
Meet at Chen Hai's place.

474
27:50.880 --> 27:52.039
Let's pay him a visit.

475
27:52.240 --> 27:52.799
Yes, sir.

476
28:32.119 --> 28:33.400
Calling me out this late...

477
28:33.880 --> 28:35.240
you're not expecting me

478
28:35.279 --> 28:36.440
to watch the sunrise with you, are you?

479
28:38.440 --> 28:40.440
You're looking in good spirits, Mr. Chen.

480
28:41.039 --> 28:43.480
Seems like you took care of Zhou Fuhai.

481
28:45.319 --> 28:46.680
If I didn't deal with Zhou,

482
28:47.079 --> 28:48.359
would I still have a foothold in Nanhai?

483
28:48.559 --> 28:49.680
Out with it. What's this really about?

484
28:51.319 --> 28:52.640
I'm not the one who asked to meet.

485
28:52.880 --> 28:54.359
It was someone else.

486
29:01.680 --> 29:02.119
Captain Bai.

487
29:06.559 --> 29:07.480
Chen Hai isn't home.

488
29:07.799 --> 29:08.880
His car isn't in the parking lot either.

489
29:09.079 --> 29:10.759
I had He Bo pull the surveillance footage.

490
29:17.839 --> 29:18.680
We got the footage.

491
29:37.039 --> 29:38.200
1:30 a.m.

492
29:39.319 --> 29:40.119
This late at night,

493
29:40.839 --> 29:42.119
he's definitely up to something.

494
29:50.119 --> 29:51.200
Contact traffic police.

495
29:51.480 --> 29:52.519
Use the road surveillance

496
29:52.839 --> 29:54.160
to track down this vehicle.

497
29:54.200 --> 29:54.720
Understood.

498
30:08.680 --> 30:09.559
All right, got it.

499
30:09.720 --> 30:10.440
You head back first.

500
30:14.079 --> 30:14.640
Captain Lu.

501
30:18.240 --> 30:18.920
What do we have?

502
30:20.279 --> 30:20.799
This house...

503
30:20.839 --> 30:22.599
was left to Chen Hai's daughter by his mother.

504
30:22.720 --> 30:24.960
It looks like a shootout between them.

505
30:25.680 --> 30:27.240
Both have gunshot residue on their hands,

506
30:27.400 --> 30:28.799
and nitrogen compounds on their bodies.

507
30:28.799 --> 30:30.799
Only their fingerprints were found on the gun.

508
30:31.559 --> 30:32.960
Did anyone nearby hear gunshots?

509
30:35.359 --> 30:37.319
This area is slated for demolition.

510
30:37.640 --> 30:39.000
Most of the residents have already moved out.

511
30:39.519 --> 30:41.039
There are no eyewitnesses at the scene.

512
30:42.680 --> 30:44.880
We only expected Chen Hai might be silenced,

513
30:45.240 --> 30:46.000
never thinking

514
30:46.039 --> 30:47.519
Hu Dong would end up dead too.

515
30:56.079 --> 30:57.799
I also think too many things don't add up.

516
30:58.119 --> 30:58.960
But unfortunately,

517
30:59.119 --> 31:00.359
there is too little evidence at the scene.

518
31:04.039 --> 31:05.920
Hu Dong did so much for Chen Hai.

519
31:06.519 --> 31:09.000
They wouldn't kill each other.

520
31:09.799 --> 31:11.880
Have Forensics run a ballistics test.

521
31:11.920 --> 31:13.119
See if there are any new leads.

522
31:20.680 --> 31:21.240
Captain Lu.

523
31:21.319 --> 31:22.599
We found Gao Jian's two close friends,

524
31:22.720 --> 31:23.759
Zhang Buzhen and Ma Zili.

525
31:24.400 --> 31:25.839
I'll send over their files right away.

526
31:26.240 --> 31:26.640
Okay.

527
31:27.119 --> 31:27.480
Okay.

528
31:29.839 --> 31:31.039
Guan Qiang has a new lead.

529
31:31.119 --> 31:32.000
Send it to the station right away.

530
31:32.519 --> 31:33.079
Let's head back to the station.

531
32:09.279 --> 32:10.519
I've been thinking for a long time,

532
32:11.599 --> 32:14.519
and I can't find a single reason to kill you.

533
32:16.519 --> 32:18.480
Is this how Fourth Brother does business?

534
32:18.880 --> 32:20.799
When a boss goes back on his word,

535
32:21.480 --> 32:22.680
how can your men

536
32:22.720 --> 32:24.240
follow you with peace of mind?

537
32:28.839 --> 32:30.839
Goading me won't work.

538
32:31.640 --> 32:33.920
While I can't find a reason to kill you,

539
32:34.519 --> 32:37.519
you'd better come up with

540
32:37.920 --> 32:39.599
a reason for me not to.

541
32:41.000 --> 32:42.000
Think carefully.

542
32:42.759 --> 32:44.559
Cherish this chance.

543
32:55.519 --> 32:58.000
The man on the left in the photo is Ma Zili.

544
32:58.200 --> 32:59.359
The one on the right is Zhang Buzhen.

545
32:59.799 --> 33:01.799
They're Gao Jian's childhood friends.

546
33:02.680 --> 33:05.000
Six months ago, Gao Jian came to Nanhai.

547
33:05.160 --> 33:05.880
Shortly after that,

548
33:06.079 --> 33:07.279
both of them also

549
33:07.279 --> 33:08.000
left Jincheng.

550
33:08.160 --> 33:09.720
I think the two of them

551
33:09.759 --> 33:11.319
are the ones Gao Jian mentioned,

552
33:11.440 --> 33:13.319
the two guys with Four-Legged Snake.

553
33:13.839 --> 33:15.160
Gao Jian said he's just passing through

554
33:15.599 --> 33:17.079
and plans to leave Nanhai.

555
33:17.839 --> 33:19.920
Now that Chen Hai and Hu Dong are dead,

556
33:21.319 --> 33:23.440
if Four-Legged Snake did it,

557
33:24.599 --> 33:26.799
they'll be leaving Nanhai very soon.

558
33:27.440 --> 33:28.640
Right now, the most important thing

559
33:29.000 --> 33:30.759
is finding their hideout.

560
33:30.920 --> 33:32.799
Maybe we can check with real estate agencies

561
33:33.319 --> 33:35.759
for recent short-term rental records.

562
33:35.759 --> 33:36.920
We might find something.

563
33:37.799 --> 33:40.200
Have all officers call the agencies.

564
33:40.519 --> 33:42.599
Check the IDs of these three men

565
33:43.000 --> 33:44.319
to see if there are any rental records.

566
33:44.599 --> 33:48.119
Focus on suburban houses and villas.

567
33:48.200 --> 33:48.720
Understood.

568
33:49.000 --> 33:49.640
Wait.

569
33:51.000 --> 33:52.920
When Four-Legged Snake escaped last time,

570
33:52.920 --> 33:54.119
the car he hijacked

571
33:54.279 --> 33:55.720
was abandoned in Luyang New Village.

572
33:56.519 --> 33:58.000
His current hideout

573
33:58.920 --> 34:00.079
shouldn't be far from there.

574
34:00.640 --> 34:01.160
Got it.

575
34:03.279 --> 34:04.799
Ding Tao, stay and help out.

576
34:05.039 --> 34:05.440
Understood.

577
34:06.039 --> 34:07.720
We'll go on standby at Luyang New Village.

578
34:14.679 --> 34:16.079
Do you know someone named Gao Jian?

579
34:16.159 --> 34:18.280
His ID number is 1440389...

580
34:22.360 --> 34:24.480
Hello, is this the agency?

581
34:31.079 --> 34:31.599
Found it!

582
34:33.400 --> 34:34.760
I'll send the location to Captain Bai first.

583
34:35.280 --> 34:36.000
Nice work!

584
34:38.400 --> 34:39.440
Captain Bai?

585
34:39.599 --> 34:40.320
We found the location.

586
34:42.960 --> 34:44.199
Brother Four, what do you think?

587
34:44.880 --> 34:47.000
I say we just get rid of this kid first.

588
34:58.639 --> 34:59.239
How about it?

589
34:59.679 --> 35:02.400
Want to come abroad with me and see the world?

590
35:06.760 --> 35:09.360
Boss Jiang wanted me to kill you.

591
35:10.119 --> 35:11.760
And I couldn't bring myself to do it.

592
35:14.199 --> 35:14.880
But...

593
35:15.400 --> 35:16.360
I can't just...

594
35:16.360 --> 35:18.119
let you go just like this, can I?

595
35:22.199 --> 35:23.599
Do I even have a choice?

596
35:25.480 --> 35:26.360
Untie him.

597
35:31.760 --> 35:33.480
We're heading to Jiangyang soon.

598
35:34.000 --> 35:35.119
Call Gao Jian.

599
35:35.480 --> 35:37.079
See how things are going over there.

600
35:41.760 --> 35:42.199
Hello,

601
35:42.840 --> 35:44.639
the number you dialed is turned off.

602
35:44.639 --> 35:45.679
His phone is off.

603
35:48.599 --> 35:50.000
Damn it. Something's wrong.

604
35:50.519 --> 35:52.199
Pack your things. Let's get out of here!

605
35:53.360 --> 35:53.960
Brother Four,

606
35:54.639 --> 35:56.440
we agreed to wait for Brother Jian to get back.

607
35:58.119 --> 35:59.519
If you keep stalling here,

608
35:59.559 --> 36:01.000
it'll be too late, you hear me?

609
36:01.159 --> 36:02.119
If you want to leave, go ahead.

610
36:02.440 --> 36:03.559
I'm waiting for Brother Jian.

611
36:05.480 --> 36:07.719
Staying here is suicide!

612
36:07.760 --> 36:08.639
Do you understand?!

613
36:09.440 --> 36:09.880
Brother Four,

614
36:10.360 --> 36:11.760
the two of us answer to Brother Jian.

615
36:12.159 --> 36:12.760
If he doesn't come back,

616
36:12.920 --> 36:14.079
we're not going anywhere.

617
36:22.480 --> 36:23.800
The police will be here any minute!

618
36:24.039 --> 36:25.000
Forget these two idiots.

619
36:25.000 --> 36:25.559
Let's go.

620
36:25.840 --> 36:26.320
Move.

621
36:31.480 --> 36:32.079
Hurry up!

622
36:35.119 --> 36:35.639
Get in the car!

623
36:40.519 --> 36:41.639
You are surrounded!

624
36:42.079 --> 36:43.039
Drop your weapons!

625
36:44.719 --> 36:45.519
Come out and surrender!

626
37:04.679 --> 37:05.800
Everyone inside the vehicle, listen up!

627
37:06.719 --> 37:08.320
We're giving you one last chance!

628
37:09.199 --> 37:10.480
Step out of the vehicle right now!

629
37:11.719 --> 37:13.039
Drop your weapons and surrender!

630
37:13.559 --> 37:14.119
What do we do?

631
37:40.280 --> 37:41.320
Why didn't we bring him?

632
37:41.760 --> 37:42.440
There was no time.

633
37:42.639 --> 37:44.159
If we delayed, none of us would escape.

634
38:06.079 --> 38:06.519
After them!

635
38:15.119 --> 38:17.079
The cops probably set up a roadblock ahead.

636
38:17.599 --> 38:18.679
We can't keep driving.

637
38:19.360 --> 38:19.920
Get out.

638
38:38.400 --> 38:39.039
Head up the mountain.

639
38:52.800 --> 38:53.559
Hurry up.

640
39:09.599 --> 39:10.320
Captain Bai,

641
39:11.920 --> 39:13.800
are you worried about Wei Kai?

642
39:16.159 --> 39:17.320
Don't worry.

643
39:17.719 --> 39:19.119
We made that chase look convincing.

644
39:19.320 --> 39:21.039
They won't suspect him at all.

645
39:21.800 --> 39:23.079
Who would've thought?

646
39:23.639 --> 39:25.840
Wei Kai actually joined Four-Legged Snake.

647
39:26.280 --> 39:27.360
Still, now that he's gone,

648
39:27.800 --> 39:30.000
who knows what new complications might arise.

649
39:42.840 --> 39:43.760
Two days ago,

650
39:43.960 --> 39:46.559
we found the bodies of Chen Hai and Hu Dong.

651
39:46.559 --> 39:48.039
Judging by the crime scene,

652
39:48.320 --> 39:50.400
it seemed they had killed each other.

653
39:50.400 --> 39:53.159
But after Forensics ran ballistics,

654
39:53.320 --> 39:54.719
we discovered new discrepancies.

655
39:55.320 --> 39:55.920
Li Jing.

656
40:00.280 --> 40:02.519
Based on where Chen Hai and Hu Dong fell,

657
40:02.679 --> 40:04.480
we tested the bullet trajectories.

658
40:05.320 --> 40:06.239
The results revealed

659
40:06.239 --> 40:07.880
that the bullet entry angles

660
40:08.159 --> 40:10.199
and their fallen positions and postures

661
40:10.360 --> 40:11.440
show a clear discrepancy.

662
40:12.480 --> 40:13.719
So our conclusion is

663
40:14.199 --> 40:15.320
that after committing the crime,

664
40:15.440 --> 40:17.239
the killer deliberately staged the scene.

665
40:17.360 --> 40:18.079
Clearly,

666
40:19.360 --> 40:20.519
the criminals

667
40:20.519 --> 40:22.360
are trying to mislead us once again.

668
40:22.360 --> 40:25.280
And the prime suspect in this case

669
40:25.280 --> 40:27.400
is a man known as Four-Legged Snake.

670
40:27.599 --> 40:29.280
During his time in Nanhai,

671
40:29.719 --> 40:31.519
he not only expanded his network,

672
40:31.960 --> 40:33.960
but also threatened Qian Feng,

673
40:34.039 --> 40:35.119
targeted Li Qiang,

674
40:35.280 --> 40:38.559
and murdered Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

675
40:39.719 --> 40:41.920
I just received the latest intel:

676
40:42.599 --> 40:44.559
he'll soon arrive in Jiangyang

677
40:44.800 --> 40:45.800
to meet up with Xiang Nan.

678
40:46.280 --> 40:48.199
If we follow this lead,

679
40:48.360 --> 40:49.079
I believe

680
40:49.559 --> 40:52.519
Xiang Dong, alias Piyazi,

681
40:52.679 --> 40:53.679
won't be far from our reach.

682
40:54.400 --> 40:54.880
Captain Lu,

683
40:55.119 --> 40:56.639
please brief everyone

684
40:56.760 --> 40:58.000
on the other details you have.

685
41:00.559 --> 41:01.320
Two days ago,

686
41:01.360 --> 41:03.280
I found a voice recorder in the parking lot.

687
41:03.400 --> 41:04.159
Forensic analysis confirmed

688
41:04.360 --> 41:05.760
it was recorded by Zhou Fuhai himself.

689
41:06.000 --> 41:06.679
Before his death,

690
41:06.760 --> 41:08.360
he feared something might happen to him,

691
41:08.360 --> 41:10.000
so he made this recording.

692
41:10.280 --> 41:11.480
In the recording, he mentioned

693
41:11.760 --> 41:13.000
Chen Hai using him

694
41:13.039 --> 41:15.159
to infiltrate Zhongtian Logistics.

695
41:15.400 --> 41:17.760
Across Zhongtian Logistics from top to bottom,

696
41:18.159 --> 41:20.480
from the GM to the admin assistant,

697
41:20.719 --> 41:22.039
down to the parcel inspectors,

698
41:22.320 --> 41:23.119
a total of eight people are involved.

699
41:23.360 --> 41:25.280
They are currently being interrogated.

700
41:25.480 --> 41:26.480
Meanwhile,

701
41:26.719 --> 41:27.480
our anti-drug squad,

702
41:27.519 --> 41:28.920
through months of investigation,

703
41:29.079 --> 41:29.920
is currently arresting

704
41:30.159 --> 41:32.800
Chen Hai and Liang Wenbiao's drug network.

705
41:33.440 --> 41:34.760
We hope to take the shortest time

706
41:35.000 --> 41:37.039
to round up all these drug traffickers.

707
41:39.159 --> 41:40.559
In addition to the leads

708
41:40.559 --> 41:41.599
we have already gathered,

709
41:41.920 --> 41:43.679
Section Chief Zhou has some new updates

710
41:43.880 --> 41:44.880
to share with everyone.

711
41:46.480 --> 41:48.360
Comrades, first I want to commend

712
41:48.440 --> 41:49.639
our anti-drug squad.

713
41:50.159 --> 41:51.719
In the shortest possible time,

714
41:52.400 --> 41:54.800
you cracked several major drug trafficking cases

715
41:55.159 --> 41:57.960
and dealt a heavy blow

716
41:58.280 --> 42:00.159
to the Piyazi gang's syndicate in Nanhai.

717
42:00.280 --> 42:02.880
On behalf of the province and city bureau,

718
42:02.960 --> 42:05.480
I thank you for your hard work.

719
42:07.039 --> 42:09.679
Furthermore, we must clearly realize

720
42:10.079 --> 42:12.599
that criminals are like weeds:

721
42:13.000 --> 42:14.079
if not uprooted completely,

722
42:14.280 --> 42:15.760
they will grow right back.

723
42:16.119 --> 42:18.320
Right now, major criminal Li Qiang

724
42:18.360 --> 42:19.239
is still at large,

725
42:19.400 --> 42:21.440
and he has taken our citizen hostage.

726
42:21.639 --> 42:23.440
We must solve this case swiftly

727
42:23.920 --> 42:26.320
to ensure the hostage's safe return.

728
42:27.599 --> 42:28.599
The hostages I'm referring to,

729
42:29.000 --> 42:31.280
besides Ms. Tian Xin, who was taken by Li Qiang,

730
42:31.480 --> 42:32.199
include another person.

731
42:32.559 --> 42:33.159
Xiao Zhang,

732
42:33.679 --> 42:36.039
pull up Professor Du Guangming's case file.

733
42:40.199 --> 42:40.920
Look here, everyone.

734
42:41.599 --> 42:44.239
A leading figure in our nation's chemical research,

735
42:44.360 --> 42:46.280
of Nanhai University's Chemical Institute,

736
42:46.320 --> 42:47.480
Professor Du Guangming.

737
42:47.639 --> 42:48.559
Two weeks ago,

738
42:48.760 --> 42:50.039
he was invited to Country M

739
42:50.039 --> 42:51.239
to attend an academic conference,

740
42:52.199 --> 42:54.119
but went missing during the event.

741
42:54.400 --> 42:55.719
Subsequent investigations reveal that

742
42:56.119 --> 42:59.159
Professor Du Guangming was abducted.

743
42:59.840 --> 43:01.039
Interpol

744
43:01.559 --> 43:02.760
has focused its suspicions

745
43:02.920 --> 43:04.400
directly on the Piyazi crime syndicate.

746
43:04.480 --> 43:07.039
The Chinese Embassy in Country M

747
43:07.480 --> 43:09.039
is currently urging Country M police

748
43:09.119 --> 43:10.519
to solve this case as soon as possible.

749
43:10.599 --> 43:13.239
We attach great importance to this case

750
43:13.239 --> 43:14.159
and have decided to dispatch

751
43:14.320 --> 43:15.840
an experienced, top-notch officer

752
43:16.000 --> 43:17.920
to assist Country M police with the investigation.

753
43:18.199 --> 43:19.360
Previous investigations indicate that

754
43:19.719 --> 43:22.840
Li Qiang will meet up with Ma Jingrong in Country M.

755
43:22.960 --> 43:24.559
Comrade Li Xiao is now instructed,

756
43:25.159 --> 43:26.079
while in Country M

757
43:26.320 --> 43:28.320
investigating Ms. Tian Xin's whereabouts,

758
43:28.920 --> 43:31.440
to also execute the special mission

759
43:31.679 --> 43:33.079
of rescuing Professor Du Guangming.
